<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SS &amp; C Tech reduced.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SS &amp; C Tech reduced.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said analyst Cato Carpenter cut SS &amp; C Technologies Inc to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- shares dropped 5/8 to 5-1/2.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
